>2	uleshort 44		Vision Research CINE Video,
>>4	uleshort	0		Grayscale,
>>4	uleshort 1		JPEG Compressed,
>>4	uleshort 2		RAW,
>>6	uleshort x		version %d,
>>20	ulelong	x		%d frames,
>>48	ulelong	x		%dx
>>52	ulelong	x		\b%d

