# why less than 32 ? does not make sense to me. GNU Emacs version is 24.5 at April 2015
#>4	byte    <32			Emacs/XEmacs v%d byte-compiled Lisp data
!:mime	application/x-elc
!:apple	EMAxTEXT
!:ext elc

